 ### LLFF Camera Pose Conversion
-Converts COLMAP's world-to-camera pose parameters into the camera-to-world transformation matrix required by the LLFF dataset format. Specifically converts the translation vector $t$ to $t'$ using $t' = -R^T \cdot t$ [S5].
